# unit-watch-perch.vrs: finds a rock top for unit-watch.vrs (the standing rule needs a spider on a spot it cannot walk
# down from, 15-30 m from Chaos). `.devperch` scans the walk data around a few spots; the log lines are read afterwards.
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 5
chat .devperch 15 30 2
expect-log \[DEV PERCH\] scan
chat .devperch 10 50 2
expect-log \[DEV PERCH\] scan
chat .devgo ravine
expect-log \[DEV TP\] ravine
wait 5
chat .devperch 15 30 2
expect-log \[DEV PERCH\] scan
chat .devperch 10 50 2
expect-log \[DEV PERCH\] scan
console TPHome
wait 5
chat .devperch 15 30 2
expect-log \[DEV PERCH\] scan
